# Icons — use @carbon/icons-react

Always use `@carbon/icons-react` for icons. It is already installed.

```js
import { Folder, Tag } from "@carbon/icons-react";

<Folder size={16} />
```

## Guidelines
- Import only the icons you need (tree-shakeable)
- Use `size={16}` for inline/label icons, `size={20}` for standalone UI elements
- Do NOT use inline SVGs or other icon libraries (heroicons, lucide, etc.)

## Common icon choices
| Use case       | Icon name       |
|----------------|-----------------|
| Project        | `Portfolio`     |
| Activity/tag   | `Tag`           |
| Timer/clock    | `Timer`         |
| Settings       | `Settings`      |
| User/profile   | `UserAvatar`    |
| Add/new        | `Add`           |
| Delete         | `TrashCan`      |
| Edit           | `Edit`          |
| Archive        | `Archive`       |
| Money/rate     | `Money`         |
